WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.122
There are people who meditate to learn serenity. They go on expensive courses, sit cross-legged on yoga mats and try to think of nothing. I consider that a waste. Anyone who wants to learn serenity needs only a railway ticket and a little time — though the latter takes care of itself anyway.

00:00:23.372 --> 00:00:53.309
My last journey from Hamburg to Cologne began with an announcement whose poetry could scarcely be surpassed: owing to a delay in operations, departure would be delayed by a few minutes. The few minutes became forty. Then the train was provided in reverse carriage order, which inspired the passengers to a spontaneous race along the platform — a form of morning exercise that others pay a gym for.

00:00:53.559 --> 00:01:23.435
Between Bremen and Osnabrück the train came to a halt in open country. At first there was no explanation, which I took as an invitation to develop theories of my own. A cow on the tracks? A philosophically minded driver pondering the point of carrying on? The announcement that followed half an hour later spoke soberly of 'a fault on another train', thereby robbing me of my finest hypothesis.

00:01:23.685 --> 00:02:00.475
In Münster the journey reached its dramatic climax: our train, the voice from the loudspeaker announced, would terminate here. Passengers for Cologne were asked to transfer to the following train, which was, however, also running late. On the platform a community of fate took shape — commuters, students and a pensioner with a folding chair who had clearly stood here before. He offered me a biscuit and told me he took this route every week to visit his granddaughter. I accepted the biscuit gratefully.

00:02:00.725 --> 00:02:27.142
When I finally reached Cologne two and a half hours late, I was a different person. I had read a book, had two conversations with strangers and seen a sunset over the Münsterland that was in no timetable. The railway, I realised, does not sell transport. It sells lifetime — just not in the quantity you ordered.
